---
description: Preserve the requested workflow and verify actual coverage before shipping
alwaysApply: true
---

Read and follow AGENTS.md, especially "Preserve the owner's workflow".
Read the active task's plan and acceptance criteria when resuming after a context reset.
Automatic loading must not become manual per-page collection without the owner's agreement.
Source limitations require official documentation and a credential-free reproducible check.
Prove the requested user journey and coverage; tests of a workaround are not acceptance.
Keep unresolved requirements explicit. Do not claim a feature is fixed from one successful example.
